01:45:55.641 --> 01:45:59.407
<i>He was instantly
promoted to store manager.</i>

01:45:59.431 --> 01:46:01.747
<i>Sam Jones moved
back to Hollywood</i>

01:46:01.771 --> 01:46:04.457
<i>with the goal of
restarting his film career.</i>

01:46:04.481 --> 01:46:06.457
<i>He currently resides in Burbank</i>

01:46:06.481 --> 01:46:08.643
<i>where he shares
a studio apartment</i>

01:46:09.271 --> 01:46:10.837
<i>with his roommate,
Brandon Routh.</i>

01:46:10.861 --> 01:46:14.627
<i>Remember Brandon Routh from
that God-awful Superman movie?</i>

01:46:14.651 --> 01:46:16.177
<i>Jesus Christ!</i>

01:46:16.201 --> 01:46:20.427
<i>Thanks for getting our hopes
up and taking a giant shit on us.</i>

01:46:20.451 --> 01:46:23.727
<i>Rex was forced to give up
his pursuit of Lori.</i>

01:46:23.751 --> 01:46:26.727
<i>Not long afterward, he
fell into a deep depression</i>

01:46:26.751 --> 01:46:29.442
<i>and died of
Lou Gehrig's disease.</i>

01:46:29.541 --> 01:46:32.107
<i>Donny was arrested
by Boston police</i>

01:46:32.131 --> 01:46:34.947
<i>and charged with
kidnapping a plush toy.</i>

01:46:34.971 --> 01:46:37.567
<i>The charges were dropped
when everyone realized</i>

01:46:37.591 --> 01:46:40.478
<i>how completely stupid
that sounded.</i>

01:46:40.561 --> 01:46:44.037
<i>Robert got a trainer, lost a
substantial amount of weight</i>

01:46:44.061 --> 01:46:45.417
<i>and went on to become</i>

01:46:45.441 --> 01:46:47.787
<i>Taylor Lautner.</i>
